+# HP Chromebook 14 G7 (Jasper Lake, eMMC), also selected by the F2FS profiles.
+# Reserve a whole-device minor plus up to 15 partitions for single/dual layouts.
+# mmc_block is the module name. This driver explicitly retains the mmcblk.
+# parameter prefix for both modular and built-in builds; do not shorten it.
