+
+# Keep SDHCI/eMMC timing, command queueing, DMA, power and card quirks automatic.
+# No universal debug_quirks, HS400, disable_cqe, or unsafe power-cycle override.
+# i915 and the ChromeOS ACPI/platform drivers autoload from hardware modaliases;
+# do not force ThinkPad/IdeaPad drivers or a panel-specific backlight protocol.
+# Audio DSP selection must remain automatic (firmware/topology dependent).
+# F2FS has no module parameters for background_gc, compression, atgc or discard.
+# These remain in hosts/installer/layout-f2fs.env (mount options), with rootwait
+# and the existing eMMC/F2FS initramfs + modules-load assets. The existing
+# nodiscard/periodic-fstrim policy avoids adding synchronous discard overhead.
