+Waybar execs `watch`; systemd owns the independent foreground daemon. All command
+and preset dispatch is closed. The stock Tomat system/user units are masked by
+installation. Config settings are atomic and restart only our transient unit;
+RuntimeDirectoryPreserve=restart keeps the upstream timer state across restart.
